Inkling-2-Small TP4
Copyright 2026 Scott Biggart

This fork modifies TensorFold at commit 223da7659. It adds the Inkling-2 family
(zig/src/families/inkling2/, zig/kernels/cuda/inkling2_*.cu, tools/zig/inkling2_*.py)
and changes some upstream files. The recipe that serves it (recipe/inkling2-tp4/) and the
release scripts are in the inkling2-sparks repository
(https://github.com/swbiggart/inkling2-sparks). These changes are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).
Outside code they include keeps its own license and notice, and the outside sources
they follow are credited, in the "Inkling-2-Small" section of THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

The Inkling-2 attention core follows the fp32 attention arithmetic of tf_ik_attention
in kortexa-ai's TensorFold fork (https://github.com/kortexa-ai/TensorFold, by francip)
at commit e2614fe, Apache License 2.0. Files adapted from it keep their Apache-2.0
header, name that source and commit, and say that they were modified. That fork's
NOTICE is TensorFold's own, above.

The Inkling-2-Small release assets bundle NVIDIA NCCL 2.30.7 (Copyright (c) 2015-2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION &
AFFILIATES; Apache License 2.0 and BSD 3-Clause, LICENSES/NCCL-LICENSE.txt) and NVIDIA cuBLAS / cuBLASLt 13.1.1.3
(proprietary, redistributed unmodified under the NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit EULA, LICENSES/NVIDIA-CUDA-EULA.txt) in lib/,
unmodified, with their license texts. They are not covered by the Apache License of this work.

The assets also carry lib/libtfgrammar.so (structured output), built from this work's zig/src/grammar/tf_grammar.cc and
the C++ sources of xgrammar v0.2.8 (Copyright (c) 2024 by XGrammar Contributors, Apache License 2.0), with the headers of
dlpack (Apache License 2.0) and picojson (BSD 2-Clause License, Copyright 2009-2010 Cybozu Labs, Inc. and 2011-2014
Kazuho Oku). Their licenses are in LICENSES/ and lib/; xgrammar's notice is LICENSES/xgrammar-NOTICE.txt.
